  "Software Details": "Softwaredetails",
  "The Review Reminder module of eCommerceGo SaaS simplifies the process of gathering valuable feedback from your customers. Once customers receive their orders, this module automatically sends them reminders to leave reviews. With this feature, you can effortlessly collect feedback, improve customer satisfaction, and boost sales.": "De Review Reminder-module van eCommerceGo SaaS vereenvoudigt het proces van het verzamelen van waardevolle feedback van uw klanten. ",
  "View Live Demo": "Bekijk livedemo",
  "Streamlined Feedback Collection": "Gestroomlijnde feedbackverzameling",
  "With the Review Reminder module, collecting customer feedback becomes a seamless process. Customers receive timely reminders to share their thoughts and experiences with your products or services. This ensures that you consistently gather valuable insights, helping you understand customer preferences and areas for improvement.": "Met de Review Reminder-module wordt het verzamelen van klantfeedback een naadloos proces. ",
  "Customizable Email Templates": "Aanpasbare e-mailsjablonen",
  "Customizing review reminder emails has never been easier. The module allows you to create email templates tailored to your brands voice and style. Whether you want to incentivize customers to leave reviews or simply thank them for their purchase, you have the flexibility to design emails that resonate with your audience.": "Het aanpassen van e-mails met beoordelingsherinneringen was nog nooit zo eenvoudig. ",
  "Manage Review Reminder Settings": "Beheer de instellingen voor beoordelingsherinneringen",
  "Take control of your review reminder process with flexible settings. You can enable or disable the review reminder button according to your preferences. This feature allows you to adjust your feedback collection strategy based on factors like product launches, seasonal promotions, or inventory changes.": "Neem de controle over uw beoordelingsherinneringsproces met flexibele instellingen. ",
  "Centralized Review Management": "Gecentraliseerd beoordelingsbeheer",
